#. この学園に来た直後、
#. ボク達が会った<CLT 3>“超高校級のギャル”江ノ島盾子<CLT>は…
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"We met the <CLT 3>Ultimate Fashionista, Junko Enoshima<CLT>\n"
"right after we all arrived here..."
msgstr ""

#. 本物の江ノ島盾子じゃなかったんだ。
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But that wasn't the real Junko."
msgstr ""

#. あの時、ボク達の目の前にいたのは、
#. 江ノ島盾子と入れ替わった<CLT 3>１６人目<CLT>の高校生…
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"The girl we saw before us was actually the <CLT 3>sixteenth<CLT>\n"
"student, who had taken Junko's place."
msgstr ""

#. …<CLT 3>戦刃むくろ<CLT>だったんだよ。
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "And that girl's name was <CLT 3>Mukuro Ikusaba<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. だけど、その彼女もすぐにモノクマ…つまり<CLT 3>黒幕<CLT>に、
#. 殺されてしまったんだ。
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"But it wasn't long before she died at the hands of\n"
"Monokuma. In other words, <CLT 3>the mastermind<CLT>..."
msgstr ""

#. 江ノ島盾子としてね…
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...Junko Enoshima."
msgstr ""

#. そして、その死体は死体安置所になっている<CLT 3>生物室<CLT>で、
#. しばらく保管された後…
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Her body was kept in the <CLT 3>bio lab<CLT>, which had been\n"
"converted into a morgue."
msgstr ""

#. 黒幕によって、<CLT 3>再利用<CLT>される事になったんだ。
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Until Junko decided to put her body <CLT 3>to use<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 黒幕は、彼女の死体を生物室から引っ張り出し、
#. ビニールシートと一緒に<CLT 3>植物庭園<CLT>に運んだ。
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Junko dragged the body out of the bio lab, using the\n"
"tarp to carry her to the <CLT 3>garden<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 戦刃むくろ殺しをでっち上げ、ジャマな霧切さんを、
#. その犯人に仕立て上げる為にね…
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"She fabricated the murder to try and frame Kyoko,\n"
"who'd proven to be one big thorn in her side."
msgstr ""

#. その際、戦刃むくろがまだ生きて、
#. 学園の中に潜んでいると思わせる為に…
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Meanwhile, she wanted us all to think Mukuro was still\n"
"alive, and hiding somewhere inside the school."
msgstr ""

#. 黒幕は、<CLT 3>覆面<CLT>を被った上で、ボクを襲ったんだ。
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So she put on a <CLT 3>mask<CLT> and then attacked me."
msgstr ""

#. そして、黒幕はボクに覆面を印象付けた後、
#. 部屋から出て行き…
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"After making sure I'd gotten a good look at the mask,\n"
"she left the room..."
msgstr ""

#. その覆面を、<CLT 3>戦刃むくろの死体<CLT>に被せたんだ。
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Then she put the same mask on <CLT 3>Mukuro's body<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. ボクを襲った覆面と、戦刃むくろが
#. <CLT 3>同一人物<CLT>であると見せかけ…
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"This was all to make us think the person who attacked\n"
"me and the corpse were <CLT 3>one and the same<CLT>..."
msgstr ""

#. 彼女はたった今死んだと、思い込ませる為にね。
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"She wanted us to believe the murder had only recently\n"
"taken place."
msgstr ""

#. そして最後に、黒幕は死体に<CLT 3>爆弾<CLT>を仕掛ける事で、
#. 証拠を隠滅したんだ。
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Finally, by strapping a <CLT 3>bomb<CLT> to the body, she was\n"
"able to destroy any remaining evidence."
msgstr ""

#. その死体の人物…つまり戦刃むくろが…
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "She needed to hide the body's true identity."
msgstr ""

#. ボク達が最初に会った江ノ島盾子と、
#. 同一人物だという事実を、隠す為にだ。
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"She had to make sure we didn't find out it was\n"
"actually the same person we'd met in the beginning."
msgstr ""

#. …これが戦刃むくろ殺しの真実だ。
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "This is the truth behind Mukuro's murder."
msgstr ""

#. そして、それを仕組んでいたのが、
#. モノクマを操っている黒幕…
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"And the one who carried it all out is the true\n"
"mastermind, the one controlling Monokuma..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>“本物の江ノ島盾子”<CLT>なんだ！！
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "The <CLT 3>real Junko Enoshima<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>違う、これじゃ推理が通らない！
#. もう一度、事件の流れを整理するんだ！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>No, I didn't lay out my reasoning right! I need to\n"
"rearrange the events of the case!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Không, lập luận thế này là sai rồi! Mình cần phải sắp xếp\n"
"lại trình tự các sự kiện trong vụ án này!\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>ボクが玄関ホールで出会った、
#. <CLT><CLT 3>“超高校級のギャル”<CLT><CLT 4>の正体は…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What was the identity of the <CLT><CLT 3>Ultimate Fashionista<CLT><CLT 4>,\n"
"who I met in the main hall...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>黒幕が戦刃むくろの死体を<CLT><CLT 3>保管していた場所<CLT><CLT 4>は…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Where did the mastermind <CLT><CLT 3>keep Mukuro's body<CLT><CLT 4>...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>黒幕はある<CLT><CLT 3>凶器<CLT><CLT 4>を持って、ボクを襲おうとしたんだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The mastermind <CLT><CLT 3>attacked<CLT><CLT 4> me with something. What was\n"
"it...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>覆面を被った黒幕が、ボクを襲った時、
#. 黒幕を止めてくれたのは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>When the masked mastermind attacked me, who was it\n"
"that stopped them...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>襲撃に失敗した黒幕は、
#. ボクの部屋から逃げ出したんだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>After their surprise attack failed, the mastermind\n"
"fled my room...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>黒幕は<CLT><CLT 3>脱いだ覆面<CLT><CLT 4>を、どうしたんだったかな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What did the mastermind do with the mask <CLT><CLT 3>after they\n"
"took it off<CLT><CLT 4>...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>最初に覆面の死体を<CLT><CLT 3>植物庭園<CLT><CLT 4>で発見した時、
#. 死体はどんな状態だったかな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What was the condition of the dead body when I first\n"
"found it in the <CLT><CLT 3>garden<CLT><CLT 4>...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>死体が<CLT><CLT 3>爆破<CLT><CLT 4>されたせいで、ボク達は、
#. 謎の覆面の正体を知る事ができなくなったんだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>We couldn't identify the mysterious body, because it\n"
"got <CLT><CLT 3>blown up<CLT><CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
